<title>UK: LME people--Standard Bank adds post in South Africa.</title>
<headline>LME people--Standard Bank adds post in South Africa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Bank London, a London Metal Exchange (LME) Associate Clearing member, has added a new post in Johannesburg.</p>
<p>Peter Buyze will join the bank in Johannesburg on June 1 with responsibility for base metal marketing, Standard Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Buyze was previously purchasing manager for Philips Electronics in Eindhoven, Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542-8065</p>
</text>
